---
// The page's data holds the Cloud, so any page that draws it reads its own.
---

[[ if .Cloud ]]
<ul>
  [[ range .Cloud ]]
  <li class="mr-[5px] inline"><a class="text-black no-underline hover:underline" href="/tags?tag=[[ .Tag ]]" style="font-size: [[ .Size ]]%">[[ .Tag ]]</a> </li>
  [[ end ]]
</ul>
[[ else ]]
<div>No tags to display.</div>
[[ end ]]
